<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="icon" href="/public/favicon.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nova+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,400,0,0" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Urbanist:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>H-api</title>
    <style>
       * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Urbanist", serif;
            color: #B8FFFF;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #010208;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .heading {
            font-size: 3rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            color: #B8FFFF; 
            border-bottom: 0.2rem solid #B8FFFF;
            text-shadow: 0.2rem 0.2rem 0.2rem #87ceeb; 
            background-color: #0193f61f;
            font-family: "Nova Mono", monospace;
            border-radius: 0rem 0rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .sub {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            text-shadow: none;
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .allLinks {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            width: 90%;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .linkContainer {
            background-color: #0193f61f;
            box-shadow: 0.2rem 0.2rem 1rem #B8FFFF;
            color: #B8FFFF;
            border-radius: 0.3rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            min-height: 15rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease, box-shadow 0.5s ease;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            animation: slideUp 1s ease forwards;
        }

        .linkContainer:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0.4rem 0.4rem 2rem #B8FFFF;
        }

        .linkDescription {
            width: fit-content;
            margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
        }

        a {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-family: "Urbanist", sans-serif;
            display: block;
            padding: 1rem;
            border: 0.05rem solid #B8FFFF;
            border-radius: 0.3rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease-in-out, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        a:hover {
            background-color: #07f7eb31;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        footer {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background-color: #0193f61f;
            border-top: 0.2rem solid #B8FFFF;
            border-radius: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0rem 0rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #B8FFFF;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .developer, .mail {
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(50px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .allLinks {
                gap: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="heading">
            H-API
            <div class="sub">
                H-API is a RESTfull API server providing comprehensive information about me ( Munimadugu Sree Harsha). This collection of self-developed APIs offers detailed insights into various aspects of my professional and personal background.
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main>
        <div class="allLinks">
            <div class="linkContainer">
                 <a href="/user/achievements" > Achievements API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                 </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                   Know my achievements
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="linkContainer">
                <a href="/user/badges" > Badges API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                    Check out my Badges
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="linkContainer">
                <a href="/user/certifications" > Certifications API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                    Here are some of the certificates I've earned.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="linkContainer">
                <a href="/user/contacts" > Contact Info API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                    Ways to contact me ...
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="linkContainer">
                 <a href="/user/projects" > Projects API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                 </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                    I invite you to explore my recent projects.
                </div>
                </div>

            <div class="linkContainer">
                 <a href="/user/skills" > Skills API 
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">
                        open_in_new
                    </span>
                 </a> 
                <div class="linkDescription">
                    I am particularly skilled at ...
                </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
        <div class="developer"> Developer : <b> M . Sree Harsha </b> </div>
        <div class="mail"> Contact me : <b><email>marvelavengersharsha@gmail.com</email></b> </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>